@(B.23.7.3 = 3-12)  @note{cf. @xref[t.6.1.01,t.6.1.01.153]{6.1.01.153}, @xref[t.6.1.01,t.6.1.01.159]{6.1.01.159}, @xref[t.6.1.02,t.6.1.02.62]{6.1.02.62}, @xref[t.6.1.02,t.6.1.02.142]{6.1.02.142}, @xref[t.6.1.03,t.6.1.03.9]{6.1.03.9}, @xref[t.6.1.16,t.6.1.16.b4]{6.1.16.b4-5}, @xref[t.6.1.22,]{6.1.22: ll. 26-27}, @xref[t.6.1.25,t.6.1.25.7]{6.1.25.7}} A …… shepherd's sex appeal is his testicles (?); a gardener's is his hair. …… a waterskin. He who does not support a wife, and who does not support a son. Although the dishonest man was unable to build his own house, he came to serve as a construction worker at my friend's house. A dishonest man chases after women's genitals; an unreliable man has two sickles. A house built by a righteous man is destroyed by a treacherous man.

#lg 23.8	proverb

@(B.23.8.13 = 13-19)  No one walks together with him or directs their steps towards him. Life  @varh[t6123.v1]{passes him by like water } @vart[t6123.v2,]{@note{1 ms. has instead:} eludes him just as he avoids others }. He is dear to no just man,  @varh[t6123.v3]{plague prevails over him } @vart[t6123.v4,]{@note{1 ms. has instead:} life is not given to him }. Like a worthless penny,  @varh[t6123.v5]{……; no one …… } @vart[t6123.v6,]{@note{1 ms. has instead:} he is thrown away; no one cares about him }. He is clothed with a garment as if a heavy punishment were assigned to him.  @varh[t6123.v7]{Who is he? His name? A man sleeping with someone's wife. } @vart[t6123.v8,]{@note{1 ms. has instead:} Who is he? He is a man who slept with someone's wife. }


